      "A GST-verified transporter is a trucking company or fleet operator whose Goods and Services Tax registration has been confirmed as active on the government GST portal. When you book one, you receive a compliant tax invoice carrying their GSTIN, which your business can use to claim input tax credit and to generate accurate e-Way Bills. As of September 2026, GST verification is the fastest trust check available to any shipper: it is free, takes about a minute, and needs no portal login.",
